    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n006",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n007",
      "type": "easily_confused",
      "note": "对顶角相等；邻补角互补。位置不同，结论也不同。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n007",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n029",
      "type": "easily_confused",
      "note": "邻补角是位置关系，互补是数量关系。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n012",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n013",
      "type": "easily_confused",
      "note": "判定是「由角推平行」；性质是「由平行推角」。方向不能反着用而不说明。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n011",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n012",
      "type": "related",
      "note": "先认清同位、内错、同旁内，再谈判定。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n018",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n019",
      "type": "related",
      "note": "等边是等腰的特殊情形，三边都相等。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n020",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n016",
      "type": "application",
      "note": "直角三角形两锐角互余，来自内角和 180°。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n022",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n023",
      "type": "related",
      "note": "三视图看「从哪边看」；展开图看「拆开哪面」。"
    },
    {
      "from": "jm-g7-geo-n008",
      "to": "jm-g7-geo-n030",
